I've noticed lately that people are often talking about the merits of
having a large stack of highly enchanted daggers for missile weapons.
The main point seems to be that you don't have to wield them to fire
them.

But I have a question.  How many daggers are we talking about?  10...
50... a thousand?  And how do you go about enchanting 50 daggers to +5
or higher?  Don't you need _alot_ of blessed enchant weapon scrolls?
And do you enchant normal daggers, or wait with enchanting until you
have enough elven daggers?

In my games, as a Valkyrie, I usually collect about 5 good daggers and
use them on neighbours, nymphs and other annoyances.  For normal
critters I use my main weapon and I never use ?oEW on anything but
artifacts.  But having a huge stack of high-damage daggers intrigues
me, so if someone could post a short dagger stack tutorial it would be
much appreciated.

One other question (that I am to lazy to look up in a spoiler).  What
are the chances of there being a magic lamp in the minetown shops?  I
always get regular lamps when I reach minetown.

